 - `/v1/model-grid` — GET (Rust Worker, `workers/forecast/src/model_grid.rs`, logic in `weather-core::model_grid`), one global model's forecast fields (temperature °C, precipitation mm/h, 10 m wind km/h + direction) 3-hourly for 72 h on a fixed 7×7 grid over ±120 km centred on `lat`/`lon` snapped to 0.25°. `model` must be a blend member (`ecmwf_ifs`, `ecmwf_aifs025_single`, `gfs_seamless`, `icon_global`, `gem_global`, `meteofrance_arpege_world`). ONE batched Open-Meteo request via `open_meteo_breaker`, cached 3 h in KV (`mgrid:v1:` keys, per model and 0.25° cell); only an Open-Meteo outage (5xx, 429, transport, timeout) counts against the breaker, never a rejected 4xx; failures and all-null models return 200 with `available: false` + `reason` (`unknown_model`, `circuit_open`, `rate_limited`, `upstream_error`, `no_data`) and are never cached. Client: `src/lib/model-grid.ts`
